0 Overview   1 a-ready  2 b-error  3 c-running  4 d-pending  5 e-hcp
R┌Help────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
d│ Current: Overview                                                        ▲ │
─│ ↑ / ↓ / j / k        scroll the matrix or preview                        ┃ │─
 │ ← / →                select env in matrix; scroll preview                ┃ │
 │ [ / ]                select previous or next environment                 ┃ │
A│ Enter                open the selected environment's full plan preview   ┃ │
b│ Tab                  switch input between matrix and preview             ┃ │
N│ Esc                  close preview; return from full plan                ┃ │
─│ 1–9                  open the numbered environment's full plan           ┃ │─
T│ Space                expand all collapsed groups, or collapse all groups ┃ │
 │ /                    filter full addresses                               ┃ │
 │ e                    filter compared environments                        │ │
 │                                                                          │ │
 │ Other                                                                    │ │
 │ PgUp / PgDn          move one page                                       │ │
 │ Home / End           go to the start or end of the matrix or preview     │ │
 │ v                    show the full plan from the top                     │ │
 │ y                    copy the selected environment's plan                │ │
 │ c                    show environment context                            │ │
 │ r                    retry a selected Error environment                  ▼ │
─│ ↑/↓/k/j/PgUp/PgDn scroll | ?/Esc close                                     │─
↑└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
e env filter | v full plan | ? help | q quit
